    "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:04:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-17T13:04:17Z",
    "body": "I think we should make this follow https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-secure-contexts/issues/69. I.e., top-level `data:` URLs are insecure, but the remainder is secure.",
